    "Offline fallback snapshot of CMS NPPES registry records.",
    "",
    "PURPOSE. The platform calls the live NPPES public read API first. If the",
    "registry cannot be reached, NppesClient consults this file so that a",
    "demonstration or an evaluation run can complete. Every result served from",
    "here is stamped OFFLINE_FALLBACK on the verification record, so a reviewer",
    "can always tell a cached answer from a live one.",
    "",
    "CONTENT. These records are synthetic. The provider names, addresses and",
    "license numbers are invented for this capstone project and describe no real",
    "person or organization. The identifiers are constructed to satisfy the CMS",
    "check-digit algorithm so that the validation path can be exercised, but they",
    "are not issued NPIs. The JSON follows the shape of a real NPPES 2.1",
    "response so that the same mapping code serves both sources.",
    "",
    "TO USE REAL DATA. Replace the records array with the results of live NPPES",
    "queries, or point app.nppes.offline-dataset at a file of your own."
